      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "89e91c1fd59965cb4597675e6e70fbbcaf4ae7340e4262ef7a4f4184d8c38c04",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "d13ae2df0a14fb70611234ef92b2743877774d9bbff4a280704299c4fa1bf603",
      "text": "Next lesson",
      "hash": "d0ae2a13d8665949dd104a2fbdedcc8bca3e647a1e131d1ebaeb31c189a553b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a8879aba35402cfcf315a7a4d1174e54f8e6ae934e7f1cc190cb2293af70663c",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "152134958493e6eb5c28bf3ba1a947c77232b92062fa703eb00b0d3c7e40c1a9",
      "text": "Debugging",
      "hash": "47fc5bfb5680bd7a9d55085c13c03c5c75ab3a5e2beb3eebd08067146a17a0f1"
    },
    {
      "id": "ef23947ae2863613a537042c5146faf287b1fe7b5cfc5c1759cf33fa4d6bc6a1",
      "text": "Up next",
      "hash": "e31da5b25f8b7324861e9aadaf5c503e7fd43e739fa3be17ebe63e999fb13df1"
    },
    {
      "id": "f81e80c9b5f2c7ac78681b33938185efcb3d7167b3e8f415a4370e792f913539",
      "text": "So far we've been getting LLMs to answer questions, scan documents, and do data extraction.",
      "hash": "3bd20c93b679161f171b871510d3e2c0adfd402ef85635febbc0182cb37746fd"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae53739eee8424705eb7db8a81477dfcadffd8ff4832aa9f0aee7a1097a9391a",
      "text": "But they can do a lot more than that. LLMs can interact with the world.",
      "hash": "e16f4fe30054de0fc830c7f33f21db0ed99bc5be9d342d10bc220634ce814e90"
    },
    {
      "id": "68e5a2853d04bc7ecaae23bc4a0d455fe45f2ab96295c28aa4ede85af8d4100b",
      "text": "The way they do that is by calling tools or functions that we provide them.",
      "hash": "aa136a74ed67c988777770a92b4feb50229cd0cf8d3366dbf749fd71e27ca5c2"
    },
    {
      "id": "286c7e15a8bc6066d171151446e25c11915d0f19135c66d0063d4d1952b9353f",
      "text": "And Vercel's AI SDK has a first-class solution for that.",
      "hash": "bc4538a9413227fa5bb9c0d2886b117d52318dafa70c0e018e176f06211d38fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "0662c7d2d36d6eeffdc0c5cd86f232eb9c5985ff5532924e1c2d0635d2213c0d",
      "text": "We're going to start by creating the simplest tool imaginable and then we're going to go on from there.",
      "hash": "c5aa935b17f8dc9493d794c3e4fc3dee6a6264063bd1b510c18a8d543ccda0da"
    },
    {
      "id": "92bf6eea9768f001ad9acb53c23e00ecb9b5e10051d8a48bafbdd79e3847bfd1",
      "text": "Scrollycoding",
      "hash": "a92db14e4d481e7975b3459710fbf8ec73dcc232e366b057507f7e2891b1d6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c5ccf6847895c1e29b87ff84c4d1e18b18e22cb06851d7d91e34356a25796e5",
      "text": "Our tool is simply going to log to the console. To create it we're going to import",
      "hash": "5afa09487bf495764a0d29f8e97af4cb664174bc959122153a235a7304cd6842"
    },
    {
      "id": "c323df7d49a8c272aa000fff378bd028374d39d285f967853304f05d9067b6df",
      "text": "The first thing that any tool needs is a description of the parameters it's going to receive.",
      "hash": "e1540b160ec663d0e3497b8e5f8314d179eda8ccdeff1d0b68940d078688f795"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4ca000893267cdf16f09d5e3eadbe25fea11f9cb485bbb2eb6529db9636399a",
      "text": "We can add this by specifying parameters on the tool.",
      "hash": "6d3e54d5a8a4c0e745ce02d2a97acea580ae7ed6758adffd5fc68cd8ee696cb7"
    },
    {
      "id": "4034a224ee68ea2308ec0c754e59ecde8f2f7a7934755fbace46fb04b3a9af9f",
      "text": "This is done with a Zod schema just like we did with structured outputs before.",
      "hash": "c1a16ffc4a99d56542e0b6f3547c45e0c0ab1e283cae26d421b57bb1fed7719b"
    },
    {
      "id": "6ec21487b1ce39e47921a35fef87a6bfd401be0206544d6fec2ff9d0b6148af3",
      "text": "We're also using",
      "hash": "3e0a634e617fa7a9340be9897995d5eccf38067bad6a5debcb2bd7417e448fa4"
    },
    {
      "id": "df232eb9436df0573aa51ea3c6a4d49fdec79dfb1ba7fd053a4468ffeae1a924",
      "text": "to describe the different parameters for the LLM.",
      "hash": "abcd6af2724b05a0207453fd8d24e2cf1601225db4ca17fe2df6941cbb9c4de0"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6fa5e89fa5f967d7d836b7c84b8c403f4964deec68a81c7cf3761dfa72ef745",
      "text": "Next we need to say what the tool is going to do.",
      "hash": "30f57199f22e11b90b146fbc5a68d302aa789651a3b70da0a1e81b5d8ad7414c"
    },
    {
      "id": "93693a4ddcd5b4f11ef7c01663e358b19a0343bbb1d9d54b18c4e445de472a60",
      "text": "We do that by specifying an",
      "hash": "e75754323013c025f6801ddeaa264a41e396311945b42f62554e6934210da92d"
    },
    {
      "id": "b36c3cca78abc0df08c0a843389ddb6bc022b08dc4b7d653bd3e29f9d64853a7",
      "text": "function.",
      "hash": "78655d4d73de012287e630a648d3bc75193043eb45bfd031f8cd041012119e1d"
    },
    {
      "id": "de989db77fbb61daf7cf01f00433804fcfe7447780c3b9b2aaf9c1e94b848cce",
      "text": "This",
      "hash": "86e1de74820a9b252ba33b2eed445b0cd02c445b5f4b8007205aff1762d7301a"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7a6a1ba0de44ed2827052123aed257fb749ccb9daf7f8c44ef1cf961987acf7",
      "text": "function can be asynchronous, so it can do virtually anything - call APIs, write to a database, etc.",
      "hash": "0817bc18755d1c6124e16eee7c4ddd7ac4bea3341f278e29d8c28ea32d622eb0"
    },
    {
      "id": "2b0ccc099e308982a59982fd5c3d09d54f22a3a0cae2b00ccf479a7ca4b895e9",
      "text": "In our case we're just going to log to the console.",
      "hash": "1dfab4d4ebda33516ec7c06e4c2d8046a73f12c9794d3c7cac5e2d7d0ce52d66"
    },
    {
      "id": "75481e448e6c1942a652592945263ea5a630cbdd0d31d06782002c87f36d61cf",
      "text": "Next we're going to add a",
      "hash": "ec5b10707b9de1eefe91556995189bca25eb56b6fe5100c875b9895d4ef8dd51"
    },
    {
      "id": "1d5014299e0f84969ff129a19f052a20bc4a94187b0825bc13b590a4f065f1f4",
      "text": "field to the tool itself.",
      "hash": "6d98a3b7b491c840ff7efc263cab4c849705f802565a6de2a43d1b9bd28295d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "15c367313928855fbb88738cdc8485eca8892be6bd85981558f8be4541e33c76",
      "text": "This tells the LLM what it's supposed to do with the tool.",
      "hash": "32a6b983943f00896b5c088968fff3daa71d03094ee70679a5b20d9188d6c56a"
    },
    {
      "id": "14cec265521bb8ed7221d078c396b534a5a0deb2a27905188e455948277ae3c3",
      "text": "Now our tool's been created, let's actually use it inside a",
      "hash": "78b31778c4d6792b08687eef579d20874dd5394b63a5b4e15487f5d00dc89bbf"
    },
    {
      "id": "a06eae65c68a58b9b8900c9f8acb4b68727093922e6ae24566b5c1c96ac4d6be",
      "text": "call.",
      "hash": "0dcbd88be59d5bffcac29a4273723df5e4c617c50d00c308f116ecd6abd37e5b"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c2e71c2a17e7f93ba1f0a55fc175c3af0e2fcec6ef7943f93c6785d04454098",
      "text": "Let's create our function called",
      "hash": "0fd852fb39ce69079001580701ce3b466d1a66a366cf064ab0078f2eab818ce8"
    },
    {
      "id": "42a0681824dd7d6234bdd96df85b1374be75a13b0bdcfcf2146ae0d49fbce5a1",
      "text": ", passing in a model and a prompt.",
      "hash": "0946ee79adb10b550fcd10ab7cbfe7ea829215f7fbbd06dce4732e6b0b5da7a4"
    },
    {
      "id": "4b8b6048f1781cac8318c2fa70034ff1e6a18cf03108e08fa02fcb16b757f817",
      "text": "We'll give it a system prompt to encourage it to use the tool.",
      "hash": "f17b6c01882ba0288984819e8fb60584227d86e8c12ee8ce76a3d5230a7cc6b5"
    },
    {
      "id": "0085daa2cdeeec05659bf64ea610e4b5f7202023690a94f71274c667cb7d1e53",
      "text": "And finally let's pass it our tool.",
      "hash": "c06566a0ae1cfd32fdb8e3fd94ec4665f06378949603354defc53681b1142b5a"
    },
    {
      "id": "75a75f7b3c06fe7766c8df18a487ae716ab7f39c1ddab1222f28fba1d49898ba",
      "text": "To recap, we've created a tool, passed it to",
      "hash": "d86a123ef1579492600608dd00af41c5829f806d0b88be4883f0ca54dfeab4e0"
    },
    {
      "id": "72fc3ddde4c5f6f2cec4bf3c8fe0e5e2bfbe5140509aacfec7a486116b81dccb",
      "text": "and given it a simple",
      "hash": "74a1f559a1740b67308c590fc84d30fa044d9f16aa8eb07e49e4b6599f691f54"
    },
    {
      "id": "4937142c8bd026971de40e50699c979851bf199f2c7c49fdee4d62ce4185fe29",
      "text": "system prompt",
      "hash": "e16202309c92180728dd7fd1c59f16004a6d5ee245538c28d2a9a22edf2dd2ab"
    },
    {
      "id": "4475710d13fde781d4b0e85fe476a099cff763f1ee39aaeef2df2d3153900758",
      "text": "Let's see what happens when we run this.",
      "hash": "fadabad62718cbdcf8bd806fe613c0aaa9a41ac998ac27ad4d5f228009bbe5dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4bd766d10ef424870b6238dfcab5efd0e00999ab1bee4f0e2eb08ada5fd144d",
      "text": "Success! We're seeing \"hello world\" printed out to the console.",
      "hash": "e4de9c6d0a7b854088816a78b7a92c39059b46f6f0bbf45f23f0d2a81635f6b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "79dc243c5341f1c6b7407487470a9dba2198fcb01e06ef37959d6075906855d9",
      "text": "That's pretty good, but it's quite opaque. How do we go in and debug this?",
      "hash": "b0c17ccd1224ec13e99be081e37c8385bb097af3c145266d6450527b2f185131"
    },
    {
      "id": "bed6962fcf1c499ee1e94fb17ff8dc6374615d17afc00d8e4b52fa9d4d8e60a5",
      "text": "Let's destructure the",
      "hash": "32448e170594332f96da3c3b8b732d3e7965f63cc00c072dbfe899ca89f0d0d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e76bccbc72b0a63f4317fbbe7923df509253af1a8697b54903611a975550a38",
      "text": "property from the result of",
      "hash": "5c4d5a038bd7e714c7c10d866ab4b28def33a32903d45ab5471a2fc9229b7390"
    },
    {
      "id": "bdea23f15a490e279b249e8863845d1f1c23de94b315ea5abc0f214bf8939de1",
      "text": "is an array of each of the steps taken by the LLM.",
      "hash": "e4ca5379a69fe708be05e30ef62c824de3deca26d632f37d137441a1bb491f93"
    },
    {
      "id": "5356625f384f22989fa16fcf229334412c0a65eba12ee732898bb3d78d9378ae",
      "text": "We'll look at",
      "hash": "fe5997be735904ae2f97c3502b123c241c49c5339c74ec0b7e368c873fbb6fd5"
    },
    {
      "id": "be78e74209895788fb4cb7fc80660318c421f4d927962e5fcf1101a05f852378",
      "text": "later because it starts to get into interesting stuff like agentic behavior and reasoning.",
      "hash": "78f974a706b871424ee539390d490d8391182bc40d8bb795ccb6990b35ed6d6e"
    },
    {
      "id": "8ec6fb31e2f48659d62713f725995cea4b250c7735616355f1eda0b057d4a17a",
      "text": "For now we're just going to pull out a property from the first step taken which is tool calls.",
      "hash": "e2b7f9140704ddfcaacbd03afc3eaf7e6c2f3bc25ebd1e301386487c88e2c56e"
    },
    {
      "id": "7904af067bb4a6eab25c657958d954ceaad4e8d5781877692f3a6b7d2238097b",
      "text": "This tells you all of the tools that were called during that step.",
      "hash": "5aa88aa4c612ef68d2a109af278fe7362d3467805c0f0fd6391d856f2b5db4a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "631acfc6e52b686f6763aaf8fbb9db63d35a5ef42b0b579c05ffd4114d683a24",
      "text": "When we run this we can see that the tool name",
      "hash": "6c79ce8f67653767118a50938d33b050fe951e4eb20c44e77be69015cbfa84d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "7a29f4c1ceb0215e355aad9af9ad4d489acab4783394123224d8ad35c310a296",
      "text": "was called.",
      "hash": "7363c9ecbe6c0d28819e778b19cf50bab2489204bfe46f3ad099482f70cb98a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "66d9d12fe7e17b069d9d1289d3578b9423b36830d1fcaafb0deb50750b366801",
      "text": "We can also see the arguments it was passed.",
      "hash": "6b452e55a1f1f80a40c5417de20ddb86dec8781ac4752937e94ebde0fdaec440"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1087da8b92983c5374b69312bb575169e234542d44dcd38a431f57b56cf375e",
      "text": "If we log",
      "hash": "c391ad807857d0d16a46e9afe6748ab6a00a2a98e584e7067256a67f5d63f730"
    },
    {
      "id": "6f346fbec8453c9c8c25fcec2782ef5188fe04645fe96b65ec4cbb0d6c989a67",
      "text": "instead...",
      "hash": "5f9389a90bf9ea9284dd5e5267765c15edfda46e643cf15ff020f2ed01f1af5b"
    },
    {
      "id": "ac1bdac3cbc0055626f0b5749d5c4c018c727085f3378cf73cbce22c143ff838",
      "text": "...we can see the result of the",
      "hash": "9caa351209b9d7869ccabced5222c53e8084cd9280665a377711e215fd4aad5a"
    },
    {
      "id": "2839168827ae2202b5ae6889c0af151b703fb66066215c805c0af3bd76f03ea7",
      "text": "tool call",
      "hash": "56e7059d39717d558a3cd6526f07f33310ec6c83132c1f7692a9fc3a37684573"
    },
    {
      "id": "f391657b2135a6f597e81742a2c47471cdc8a49ec653e267f9d885234f51c1dd",
      "text": ". In this case we didn't return anything from our function so it's",
      "hash": "04f15c6d52e254604f141aca5fec73839ee47f2637cddda3e26c74a0d1c1fc4d"
    },
    {
      "id": "0517654bce158bdfffb61778f01165fac3fd6cc75e2f8e9bfcb22db51e1af660",
      "text": "These",
      "hash": "91273d498d36840939198a595c15be1749ad54bf693637c602695124e97a2565"
    },
    {
      "id": "7181a0d432f355b2f7313c431c0b4b8dcbb4835546e5a1ec5b470391b3477bbf",
      "text": "can be fed back into the LLM to provide it more information, especially when run over multiple steps.",
      "hash": "0a8f7d011e4e4a5139afd4114bbadd8bcf37e370b422638604a9c9e9efe8947c"
    },
    {
      "id": "e85230b3f9a2ea664e352959ff6389523d18b9d7a376eda59dfd62751c33ecd4",
      "text": "So debugging using",
      "hash": "d7ce6af59458fe9068e93a187c002acce58c27df74611d9c4d079f813f9d4b73"
    },
    {
      "id": "165878a2660f45e92f32ac83a57181f1dbe220d527daf39e342659fbf9d0fd69",
      "text": "is a way that you can get some insight as to what is happening with your tool calls.",
      "hash": "2f65243d30b20ec44844393649686932d12405fcee36f2198c3cf14e55f90282"
    },
    {
      "id": "9d097475ef6f20c10db411920822e2a80a42a784177f1b3630a99306a8016d69",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
    {
      "id": "715468e10edf0d041c1b78118f40952a7da641bbf3ed772ec78ece26bb141031",
      "text": "Share on Bluesky",
      "hash": "08863b88a05c60410c38c4caec5bc72535b0f01793ce6cee9171b6358b2c11da"
    },
    {
      "id": "14acf0f06da37664a248916418a819c222a2af8677994be8d6211358ce440e5e",
      "text": "Share on LinkedIn",
      "hash": "ab87c050148bd1d372e3ec3483a606127a7a1faec0f1ca5543bc3465d84fe6c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "38ec448bbf77d8a23d35aa1aea37d1efd3f6524046cd3d780b93a9ac54737337",
      "text": "Copy URL",
      "hash": "b26d1037f1c2da31a0296d915982f12049f91bfedb998b105ce967b73a796699"
